## Shared snippet dm-model.vm (shared/vm), inlined by tools/build-widget.py at "## BW_SHARED dm-model.vm".
## Normalizes and validates the parsed model and resolves the declared documents (docs/DATA_MODEL_FORMAT.md,
## docs/ARCHITECTURE.md 3.4-3.6). Needs dm-read.vm and dm-yaml.vm ($dmKind, $dmVal, $dmKeys, $dmCnt, $dmLine, $dmProbs).
## Output:
##   $dmRoles  list of maps: key, title, line, unexp (error|warning|ignore), types (list of maps: type, min, max (Integer,
##             -1 = none), ignored (true/false), line), decl (declared documents, text), docs (list of maps: decl, key,
##             project, space, name, title, found), bound (true when the bindings name the role)
##   $dmRoleByKey  role key -> role map
##   $dmRules  list of maps: id, from, ft, role, rname, to, tt, fmin, tmin (Integer), sev, line
##   $dmUnexpLinks  severity of links that match no rule (error|warning|info|ignore, default ignore)
##   $dmName, $dmVersion, $dmErrors, $dmWarnings (counts of $dmProbs)
##   $dmTypeNames / $dmRoleNames  id -> name from the project configuration (verified on 2512, dmSpike S6)
## Project-specific names (types, link roles, documents) come only from the model and the project configuration.

